        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.084,
            0.744,
            0.164
          ],
          "content": "While travelling to and from school, observe your surroundings and look out for a variety of plants and animals. Add the name of any plant or animal that you have not listed before in Tables 2.1 and 2.2."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.17,
            0.441,
            0.192
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Activity 2.2: Let us appreciate"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.203,
            0.743,
            0.265
          ],
          "content": "Close your eyes for 30 seconds and think of one plant and one animal that you have closely observed and appreciated very much."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.267,
            0.743,
            0.308
          ],
          "content": "Now each one of you can draw the plant and animal that you thought of on the blackboard."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.312,
            0.743,
            0.352
          ],
          "content": "What are your observations about the various plants and animals that have been drawn?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.359,
            0.811,
            0.733
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_4_image_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.751,
            0.743,
            0.792
          ],
          "content": " How many different plants and animals did the entire class draw on the blackboard?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.796,
            0.743,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": " Do you think that there may be many more varieties of plants and animals other than those drawn on the board?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.859,
            0.744,
            0.902
          ],
          "content": "The variety of plants and animals found in a particular region contributes to the **biodiversity** of that region."
        },
        {
          "type": "aside_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.889,
            0.716,
            0.91,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": "Diversity in the Living World"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
